### Search pages - empty query
GET {{apiUrl}}/search

### Search pages - basic query
GET {{apiUrl}}/search?q=getting started

### Search pages - single word
GET {{apiUrl}}/search?q=markdown

### Search pages - multiple words
GET {{apiUrl}}/search?q=wiki pages

### Search pages - with special characters
GET {{apiUrl}}/search?q="getting started"

### Search pages - URL encoded
GET {{apiUrl}}/search?q=getting%20started%20guide